# Why paint a child's game? Chardin's The House of Cards
tags: ["chardin","still life painting","17th century art","composition and light","everyday moments in art"]
teaches: ["art-history/chardin","concepts/memento-mori","methods/visual-attention","vocabulary/still-life"]
